.TH SONIC-PI 1 "July 2026" "sonic-pi" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sonic-pi \- live coding music synth for everyone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sonic-pi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sonic-pi
starts the Sonic Pi graphical environment: a code editor wired to a live
synthesis engine, for composing and performing music by writing and
re-running code while it plays. The built-in help pane carries the full
tutorial.
.SH OPTIONS
.B sonic-pi
takes no options of its own, though the standard Qt options (such as
.BR \-platform )
are accepted.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.sonic-pi
Per-user state: configuration, buffer contents, logs and recordings.
.SH SEE ALSO
The built-in help pane carries the full tutorial and reference
documentation, also installable as the
.B sonic-pi-server-doc
package, and available with much more at
.IR https://sonic-pi.net .
.SH AUTHOR
Sam Aaron and the Sonic Pi Core Team.
